    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/local-business-directory/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Local Business Directory is a versatile and modern solution that helps communities showcase and promote local businesses with ease. Whether you're creating a directory listing for shops, restaurants, healthcare providers, or various service professionals, this design accommodates multiple sectors, including fitness, pet services, and travel. Built on Bootstrap, it guarantees a responsive and mobile-friendly experience, optimized for performance and SEO, ensuring smooth browsing on all devices. Tailored for developers and owners of business directory agencies, the theme offers extensive customization options such as Google Maps integration and call-to-action buttons, enhancing user engagement. It supports location-based business listings with advanced filtering and categorization, making it perfect for consulting and marketing professionals. With an emphasis on creating a visually appealing city guide WordPress platform, this directory portal equips you with all the tools needed to establish an effective local guide that seamlessly connects vendors with their customers."
    },
